WEBVTT

00:00.840 --> 00:02.590
<b>It's finished!</b>

00:09.890 --> 00:12.730
<b>Here are the menu items
that should sell well at a stall</b>

00:12.730 --> 00:14.730
<b>during the Foundation Festival.</b>

00:14.730 --> 00:18.190
<b>So impressive! So many!</b>

00:18.190 --> 00:21.320
<b>I've never seen a dumpling
made of semesa before!</b>

00:21.320 --> 00:23.910
<b>How do you make these, Miss Selma?</b>

00:23.910 --> 00:26.490
<b>It's easy. I'll teach you later.</b>

00:26.490 --> 00:28.290
<b>Yay!</b>

00:30.160 --> 00:31.830
<b>You want to sell all of those?</b>

00:31.830 --> 00:35.460
<b>I just asked her to make anything
she could think of that might sell.</b>

00:35.460 --> 00:39.500
<b>The Semroid Troupe will be
arriving tonight at the earliest.</b>

00:39.500 --> 00:42.630
<b>When they try the food at
the welcoming party tomorrow,</b>

00:42.630 --> 00:47.050
<b>we can use their reaction
to narrow down our selections.</b>

00:50.680 --> 00:55.440
<b>All right, everyone! Let's look forward
to the party tomorrow!</b>

00:55.440 --> 00:57.020
<b>Yes!</b>

00:58.940 --> 01:02.740
<b>Great. I'm glad everyone
seems to be enjoying this.</b>

01:02.740 --> 01:04.910
<b>Yes, but...</b>

01:04.910 --> 01:06.660
<b>Is something wrong?</b>

01:06.660 --> 01:12.370
<b>Even if we do narrow down the menu,
I'm afraid we'll still be short-staffed.</b>

01:12.370 --> 01:13.500
<b>You're right...</b>

01:13.500 --> 01:18.630
<b>Cooking, serving,
sometimes directing traffic, even.</b>

01:18.630 --> 01:23.800
<b>Yes. Perhaps we should consider
hiring some temporary staff.</b>

01:27.390 --> 01:30.510
<b>I'm sorry to disturb you
so late at night, Mr. Ryoma.</b>

01:30.510 --> 01:33.390
<b>I brought you the leader
of the Semroid Troupe.</b>

01:33.390 --> 01:35.770
<b>Oh, right! Come in!</b>

01:39.860 --> 01:44.110
<b>A pleasure to make
your acquaintance, great sage.</b>

03:14.950 --> 03:19.960
<b>"Episode 8"
"Ryoma and the Traveling Entertainer"</b>

03:20.080 --> 03:23.960
<b>My name is Prenance Semroid.</b>

03:23.960 --> 03:27.840
<b>I may appear young, but I am the leader
of a troupe of traveling entertainers.</b>

03:27.840 --> 03:30.930
<b>It is truly an honor to meet you.</b>

03:30.930 --> 03:33.390
<b>The honor is mine.</b>

03:33.390 --> 03:36.640
<b>Also, please call me by my name.</b>

03:36.640 --> 03:39.350
<b>"Sage" is way too much.</b>

03:39.350 --> 03:43.400
<b>Oh! How humble!</b>

03:44.230 --> 03:45.940
<b>The music box.</b>

03:45.940 --> 03:49.400
<b>You are the inventor of that exquisite
little box which plays delicate music.</b>

03:49.400 --> 03:53.820
<b>What word other than "sage"
can capture your great wisdom?</b>

03:56.240 --> 03:58.160
<b>However,</b>

03:58.160 --> 04:00.620
<b>if that is your desire, great sage,</b>

04:00.620 --> 04:04.290
<b>from now on,
I shall address you as "Mr. Ryoma."</b>

04:04.290 --> 04:06.670
<b>Th-Thank you.</b>

04:06.670 --> 04:11.170
<b>No, it is I who must thank you.</b>

04:11.170 --> 04:17.390
<b>The music box will allow me to
distribute my music far and wide.</b>

04:17.390 --> 04:23.520
<b>Also, thank you so much for
providing us with a greenroom.</b>

04:23.520 --> 04:26.980
<b>Our entire troupe should have
come here to express our gratitude.</b>

04:26.980 --> 04:30.820
<b>I apologize for coming alone.</b>

04:30.820 --> 04:34.240
<b>Oh, no. You must be tired from your trip.</b>

04:34.240 --> 04:37.830
<b>It's also very late.
Please get some rest.</b>

04:37.830 --> 04:40.870
<b>I appreciate your understanding.</b>

04:40.870 --> 04:44.710
<b>We were on the highest alert
during the entire trip to Gimul.</b>

04:44.710 --> 04:46.750
<b>Did something happen?</b>

04:46.750 --> 04:50.210
<b>Yes. We traveled across
the southern plains,</b>

04:50.210 --> 04:53.760
<b>and we were told that tunnel ants
were seen along the highway.</b>

04:53.760 --> 04:54.890
<b>Ahh.</b>

04:54.890 --> 04:58.510
<b>Tunnel ants? Are those dangerous monsters?</b>

04:58.510 --> 05:00.430
<b>No, not particularly.</b>

05:00.430 --> 05:04.350
<b>However, they specialize
in digging the ground.</b>

05:04.350 --> 05:07.480
<b>They build vast colonies underground.</b>

05:07.480 --> 05:14.400
<b>Carriages that travel over these colonies
could cause a collapse, trapping them.</b>

05:14.400 --> 05:18.870
<b>Fortunately, we've been able to
avoid such a disaster, but...</b>

05:22.370 --> 05:27.170
<b>I hope that doesn't affect the preparation
or turnout of the Foundation Festival.</b>

05:27.170 --> 05:31.130
<b>The Adventurer's Guild
must be working on it.</b>

05:31.130 --> 05:34.380
<b>Mr. Callum, I'll head over there tomorrow.</b>

05:34.380 --> 05:38.890
<b>Understood. I'll handle the shop
and preparations for the party.</b>

05:38.890 --> 05:43.980
<b>Oh! You excel not only in wisdom,
but valor, as well!</b>

05:43.980 --> 05:47.600
<b>The gods must truly love you, Mr. Ryoma!</b>

05:51.820 --> 05:53.400
<b>Oh, hello, Mr. Ryoma.</b>

05:53.400 --> 05:55.240
<b>Hello, Miss Paena.</b>

05:55.240 --> 05:58.620
<b>Yes, how can I help you today?</b>

05:58.620 --> 06:02.330
<b>I heard tunnel ants were spotted
in the southern plains.</b>

06:02.330 --> 06:05.960
<b>Oh, you already know. One moment.</b>

06:05.960 --> 06:08.920
<b>Tunnel ant related jobs...</b>

06:08.920 --> 06:10.590
<b>Here it is!</b>

06:10.590 --> 06:12.920
<b>Thank you.</b>

06:12.920 --> 06:19.300
<b>Hunting, colony locating,
and digging up the colony.</b>

06:19.300 --> 06:22.260
<b>Which one needs the most help?</b>

06:22.260 --> 06:26.230
<b>Well... That would be
the colony locating part.</b>

06:26.230 --> 06:29.560
<b>It's a time-consuming job,
so it's not popular.</b>

06:29.560 --> 06:34.530
<b>I see. I'll join in on that part, then.</b>

06:34.530 --> 06:36.780
<b>Thank you!</b>

06:45.540 --> 06:50.170
<b>I want to find tunnel ant colonies.
I'm counting on you all!</b>

06:54.880 --> 06:57.920
<b>All right, Share Sensation.</b>

07:01.220 --> 07:03.640
<b>According to Miss Paena...</b>

07:03.640 --> 07:08.890
<b>Tunnel ants pile the soil they dig up
around their colonies.</b>

07:08.890 --> 07:12.270
<b>So, to find the colonies, please look for
ground that appears to have been dug up!</b>

07:12.270 --> 07:14.820
<b>The colony should be nearby.</b>

07:17.280 --> 07:19.900
<b>Ground that's been dug up...</b>

07:23.160 --> 07:25.620
<b>Found it! Hmm?</b>

07:33.250 --> 07:34.880
<b>Is that...</b>

07:37.050 --> 07:38.130
<b>Hey!</b>

07:38.130 --> 07:39.300
<b>Hmm?</b>

07:41.010 --> 07:42.640
<b>Hey, it's Ryoma.</b>

07:42.640 --> 07:46.140
<b>Hi. I guess you guys took the job, too.</b>

07:46.140 --> 07:50.770
<b>Yes. We collect herbs
and stuff around here, too.</b>

07:50.770 --> 07:52.900
<b>We wanted to help settle things down.</b>

07:52.900 --> 07:54.980
<b>I see, so that's why.</b>

07:57.360 --> 07:59.110
<b>Hey...</b>

07:59.110 --> 08:01.070
<b>Hmm? Oh, right.</b>

08:01.070 --> 08:04.410
<b>This is Ryoma. You remember,
I told you about him.</b>

08:04.410 --> 08:07.370
<b>Oh! The super strong slime guy!</b>

08:07.370 --> 08:10.830
<b>I guess that's one way
to remember a person...</b>

08:10.830 --> 08:15.790
<b>Nice to meet you. I'm Ryoma Takebayashi.</b>

08:15.790 --> 08:20.340
<b>I'm Finia. Hello.</b>

08:20.340 --> 08:22.970
<b>I'm Ruth, and this is...</b>

08:22.970 --> 08:25.100
<b>Rumille, his little sister.</b>

08:25.100 --> 08:29.220
<b>We all live in the slums,
and we grouped up.</b>

08:29.220 --> 08:32.770
<b>I see. Seeing how you're
carrying the ant carcass,</b>

08:32.770 --> 08:35.440
<b>I guess you took up
the hunting part of the job?</b>

08:35.440 --> 08:39.900
<b>Yes. We want to collect their carapaces.</b>

08:39.900 --> 08:41.530
<b>The carapace?</b>

08:41.530 --> 08:45.240
<b>Yeah. We have a big bro in the slums
who's apprenticing as an armorer.</b>

08:45.240 --> 08:50.370
<b>If we bring him materials, he can make
armor and shields and stuff for cheap!</b>

08:50.370 --> 08:54.710
<b>I thought this would be a good opportunity
to get everyone some decent armor.</b>

08:54.710 --> 08:58.710
<b>But... Yeah, this is all we got.</b>

08:58.710 --> 09:01.720
<b>We couldn't find the ants at all.</b>

09:03.130 --> 09:07.390
<b>In that case, shall I take you
to the colonies?</b>

09:07.390 --> 09:10.270
<b>I took on the colony
locating part of the job.</b>

09:10.270 --> 09:11.600
<b>Are you sure?</b>

09:11.600 --> 09:14.600
<b>We should support each other in need.</b>

09:17.060 --> 09:19.150
<b>Then we'll gladly take your help, Ryoma!</b>

09:19.150 --> 09:20.570
<b>Yes!</b>

09:24.610 --> 09:26.320
<b>Where's the colony?</b>

09:26.320 --> 09:27.660
<b>One moment.</b>

09:31.620 --> 09:34.500
<b>You're up, everyone.</b>

09:34.500 --> 09:35.920
<b>What are these?</b>

09:35.920 --> 09:38.420
<b>Metal and iron slimes.</b>

09:38.420 --> 09:40.590
<b>So many...</b>

09:40.590 --> 09:44.720
<b>Please stand back. I'll find the colonies.</b>

09:45.720 --> 09:49.140
<b>Everyone, line up!</b>

09:53.350 --> 09:55.810
<b>Slowly move forward!</b>

10:00.690 --> 10:03.030
<b>Are you sure you can
locate the colony this way?</b>

10:03.030 --> 10:07.200
<b>Slimes are good at detecting danger. So...</b>

10:29.470 --> 10:32.010
<b>Wow.</b>

10:32.010 --> 10:34.020
<b>Okay, your turn.</b>

10:37.440 --> 10:39.980
<b>Hunting the ants is your job, right?</b>

10:39.980 --> 10:42.520
<b>I'll help if you get in trouble,
so do your best.</b>

10:42.520 --> 10:45.400
<b>Y-Yeah! Let's go, guys!</b>

10:49.860 --> 10:53.330
<b>I shouldn't do all of their work for them.</b>

11:13.970 --> 11:15.350
<b>Rumille!</b>

11:15.350 --> 11:17.140
<b>I know!</b>

11:20.940 --> 11:24.150
<b>Fly away!</b>

11:25.610 --> 11:27.440
<b>Yay!</b>

11:27.440 --> 11:29.360
<b>They're doing great.</b>

11:29.360 --> 11:33.450
<b>Oops, I have to do my job, too.</b>

11:35.290 --> 11:37.080
<b>Earth Needle!</b>

11:41.000 --> 11:43.130
<b>Okay, let's go to the next one!</b>

11:43.130 --> 11:45.920
<b>Got it! Counting on you, Ryoma!</b>

11:48.800 --> 11:50.800
<b>Long time no see.</b>

11:54.180 --> 11:55.810
<b>Eyes!</b>

12:00.230 --> 12:02.020
<b>Good.</b>

12:02.020 --> 12:03.860
<b>Ryoma.</b>

12:03.860 --> 12:05.650
<b>Yes, what's up?</b>

12:05.650 --> 12:08.900
<b>It's getting late. Let's head back.</b>

12:08.900 --> 12:10.820
<b>Did you collect enough carapaces?</b>

12:10.820 --> 12:13.870
<b>Yeah. This is more than enough.</b>

12:13.870 --> 12:17.330
<b>Besides, we can't carry anymore.</b>

12:23.830 --> 12:26.750
<b>Thank you so much for today, Ryoma.</b>

12:26.750 --> 12:29.960
<b>This should be enough to have
armor made for all of us.</b>

12:29.960 --> 12:32.340
<b>You really helped us out.</b>

12:32.340 --> 12:36.890
<b>Don't mention it. You were the ones
that did the actual fighting.</b>

12:36.890 --> 12:41.230
<b>But you helped when we were in trouble.</b>

12:41.230 --> 12:43.310
<b>Also, if you didn't find
the colonies first,</b>

12:43.310 --> 12:47.020
<b>we wouldn't have been able to
hunt so many. Thank you.</b>

12:47.020 --> 12:51.530
<b>I'm sure we'll get paid a lot
for getting so many!</b>

12:51.530 --> 12:54.740
<b>Maybe we'll have money to enjoy
the Foundation Festival with!</b>

12:54.740 --> 12:59.870
<b>We won't have that much money left over.
We're getting five full sets of armor.</b>

12:59.870 --> 13:04.580
<b>Then let's go again tomorrow!
We'll hunt as many as we did today!</b>

13:04.580 --> 13:08.840
<b>Like I just said, we were only able to
hunt so many thanks to Ryoma.</b>

13:08.840 --> 13:11.840
<b>Without knowing where
the colonies are, we can't.</b>

13:11.840 --> 13:13.380
<b>Ryoma can come with us, then!</b>

13:13.380 --> 13:15.340
<b>Rumille, stop being selfish!</b>

13:15.340 --> 13:16.550
<b>Boo.</b>

13:16.550 --> 13:21.470
<b>Sorry, Ryoma. Don't worry about
what she said. You're busy, right?</b>

13:21.470 --> 13:26.440
<b>Yes, I'm sorry. I'm supposed to put up
a stall for the Foundation Festival.</b>

13:26.440 --> 13:28.270
<b>Oh, I know!</b>

13:33.570 --> 13:36.070
<b>The manager is late.</b>

13:36.070 --> 13:37.370
<b>Mr. Callum.</b>

13:37.370 --> 13:39.660
<b>Welcome back-- Hmm?</b>

13:40.830 --> 13:42.870
<b>Who are they...?</b>

13:42.870 --> 13:46.420
<b>I met them today while
doing my job for the guild.</b>

13:46.420 --> 13:49.250
<b>I was hoping they could
help us with the stall.</b>

13:49.250 --> 13:50.920
<b>Hmm...</b>

13:54.840 --> 13:56.090
<b>Beck?</b>

13:57.050 --> 13:59.050
<b>Mr. Dolce!</b>

13:59.050 --> 14:01.470
<b>Mr. Dolce, do you know them?</b>

14:01.470 --> 14:04.850
<b>Yes. I take care of them
sometimes at the slums.</b>

14:04.850 --> 14:06.520
<b>I see.</b>

14:06.520 --> 14:12.110
<b>Well, if the manager recommends them and
Mr. Dolce knows them, I don't see an issue.</b>

14:12.110 --> 14:15.700
<b>I am Callum,
assistant manager of this shop.</b>

14:15.700 --> 14:18.450
<b>Nice to meet you all.</b>

14:19.320 --> 14:22.580
<b>N-Nice to meet you!</b>

14:22.580 --> 14:29.500
<b>Mr. Callum, would it be all right
to have them join the party tonight?</b>

14:29.500 --> 14:31.840
<b>Yes, that's fine.</b>

14:31.840 --> 14:33.840
<b>What? Are you sure?</b>

14:33.840 --> 14:35.920
<b>We came in so suddenly.</b>

14:35.920 --> 14:39.930
<b>It's fine, we prepared extra food.</b>

14:39.930 --> 14:44.600
<b>This event is for everyone to get to
know each other before the festival.</b>

14:44.600 --> 14:47.770
<b>Please enjoy.</b>

14:49.520 --> 14:52.480
<b>I'll discuss your pay later.</b>

14:52.480 --> 14:56.690
<b>Mr. Dolce, can I ask you
to take care of them?</b>

14:56.690 --> 14:59.950
<b>Understood. I will introduce them
to the others.</b>

14:59.950 --> 15:01.200
<b>Thank you.</b>

15:01.200 --> 15:02.580
<b>Well, Mr. Callum.</b>

15:02.580 --> 15:07.750
<b>Yes, Manager. Please greet everyone.</b>

15:07.750 --> 15:13.040
<b>Everyone, my name is Ryoma Takebayashi,
manager of Bamboo Forest.</b>

15:13.040 --> 15:16.510
<b>Please allow me to say
a few words to greet you all.</b>

15:16.510 --> 15:19.760
<b>Thank you for gathering today.</b>

15:19.760 --> 15:24.060
<b>Let's all work together to make this
a great Founding Festival!</b>

15:24.060 --> 15:24.890
<b>Cheers!</b>

15:24.890 --> 15:27.140
<b>Cheers!</b>

15:28.390 --> 15:30.270
<b>Here's the food!</b>

15:30.270 --> 15:33.270
<b>Everyone, please enjoy!</b>

15:33.270 --> 15:35.320
<b>Yes, please!</b>

15:42.070 --> 15:44.200
<b>It's delicious.</b>

15:44.200 --> 15:47.500
<b>This is a great party, Mr. Ryoma!</b>

15:47.500 --> 15:50.500
<b>Mr. Prenance, how do you like the food?</b>

15:50.500 --> 15:52.540
<b>It exceeded my expectations.</b>

15:52.540 --> 15:57.340
<b>The members of my troupe are
also enjoying it, as you can see!</b>

15:57.340 --> 15:59.130
<b>So good!</b>

16:04.140 --> 16:08.100
<b>I apologize for my gluttonous niece.
I am Sordio.</b>

16:08.100 --> 16:11.850
<b>My niece Maiya and I are sword dancers.</b>

16:11.850 --> 16:13.020
<b>Sword dancers?</b>

16:13.020 --> 16:17.900
<b>They are masters in the art of slicing things
with their swords while dancing.</b>

16:17.900 --> 16:20.240
<b>Also, every festival has its fights.</b>

16:20.240 --> 16:23.780
<b>If something happens, please call on them.</b>

16:23.780 --> 16:25.660
<b>Thank you.</b>

16:25.660 --> 16:29.040
<b>It's reassuring to have
someone like that around.</b>

16:29.040 --> 16:33.290
<b>If you need anything,
feel free to ask either Maiya or me.</b>

16:33.290 --> 16:35.170
<b>Ask me for what, Uncle?</b>

16:35.170 --> 16:38.630
<b>We will help provide security
at this establishment.</b>

16:38.630 --> 16:42.510
<b>Oh, right. Nice to know you, bossman.</b>

16:44.430 --> 16:47.050
<b>The food is great!</b>

16:47.050 --> 16:51.020
<b>Either introduce yourself
or offer a review, not both!</b>

16:51.020 --> 16:53.270
<b>I'm glad you like it.</b>

16:53.270 --> 16:58.650
<b>You should leave some room
for dessert, though.</b>

16:58.650 --> 17:01.190
<b>What?! Seriously?!</b>

17:01.190 --> 17:03.860
<b>Why would you then start eating more...?</b>

17:03.860 --> 17:07.330
<b>I thought I should finish everything up
before dessert arrives.</b>

17:09.910 --> 17:11.370
<b>What's this?</b>

17:11.370 --> 17:15.210
<b>It's a dumpling made of semesa.
It's delicious.</b>

17:18.040 --> 17:19.670
<b>It's awesome!</b>

17:21.840 --> 17:24.180
<b>It really is delicious.</b>

17:24.180 --> 17:26.590
<b>It's so good...</b>

17:30.060 --> 17:32.180
<b>There's plenty more.</b>

17:32.180 --> 17:34.730
<b>How are these made?</b>

17:35.650 --> 17:39.690
<b>Ryoma, you really are awesome.</b>

17:39.690 --> 17:45.320
<b>It's not just me. I received help
from the people around me.</b>

17:45.320 --> 17:47.410
<b>That's still awesome, though!</b>

17:47.410 --> 17:50.160
<b>And you're strong, too.</b>

17:50.160 --> 17:53.500
<b>Yeah, the tunnel ant went down instantly.</b>

17:53.500 --> 17:57.630
<b>Say, Ryoma, how is it you're so strong?</b>

17:59.130 --> 18:01.250
<b>What brought that about?</b>

18:01.250 --> 18:03.510
<b>Well, um...</b>

18:03.510 --> 18:08.800
<b>Don't you ever feel scared while fighting?</b>

18:08.800 --> 18:11.060
<b>Oh, I remember.</b>

18:15.730 --> 18:17.020
<b>I see.</b>

18:17.020 --> 18:19.310
<b>You're being weak again.</b>

18:19.310 --> 18:21.820
<b>I'm sorry...</b>

18:21.820 --> 18:24.110
<b>So, do you?</b>

18:24.110 --> 18:28.950
<b>Hmm. When I'm fighting,
I'm concentrating on that,</b>

18:28.950 --> 18:32.120
<b>so I don't really feel scared.</b>

18:32.120 --> 18:33.620
<b>I see.</b>

18:33.620 --> 18:39.540
<b>It's all right. You'll learn through
training and experience.</b>

18:39.540 --> 18:41.540
<b>Don't rush yourself, work hard!</b>

18:41.540 --> 18:45.880
<b>Wist, you have some
great friends around you.</b>

18:45.880 --> 18:49.930
<b>Ryoma's right. You can rely on us.</b>

18:49.930 --> 18:52.930
<b>We're relying on you, too.</b>

18:53.970 --> 18:55.220
<b>Yeah.</b>

19:01.400 --> 19:05.070
<b>I'm sorry I brought them so suddenly.</b>

19:05.070 --> 19:09.110
<b>No, I was the one who suggested
we needed more help.</b>

19:09.110 --> 19:12.870
<b>Thank you for taking care
of that so quickly.</b>

19:13.740 --> 19:16.450
<b>But anyway...</b>

19:16.450 --> 19:20.500
<b>We've become quite a large group.</b>

19:20.500 --> 19:22.790
<b>When I first came to this town,</b>

19:22.790 --> 19:27.970
<b>I didn't imagine I'd be
working with so many people.</b>

19:28.880 --> 19:30.840
<b>Yes.</b>

19:30.840 --> 19:33.220
<b>Yes, indeed.</b>

19:34.560 --> 19:37.850
<b>Dear Lady Eliaria Jamil.</b>

19:37.850 --> 19:42.100
<b>We held a party today to get everyone
to know each other for the festival.</b>

19:42.100 --> 19:44.480
<b>There was a huge turnout,</b>

19:44.480 --> 19:47.610
<b>and it really made me realize that
I have so many people in my life now</b>

19:47.610 --> 19:50.320
<b>that I can call friends.</b>

19:50.320 --> 19:54.830
<b>I'm sure you have worries about
going to the academy in the capital,</b>

19:54.830 --> 20:00.580
<b>but I'm sure you'll be able to
make friends there quickly.</b>

20:02.420 --> 20:04.880
<b>Good luck, Elia!</b>

20:08.210 --> 20:11.550
<b>All right, I'll be taking off now.</b>

20:11.550 --> 20:15.640
<b>Listen, Elia. If anything happens,
send me a letter.</b>

20:15.640 --> 20:19.480
<b>In fact, send letters regardless!
Every day if you want!</b>

20:19.480 --> 20:22.100
<b>My dear, you're worrying her.</b>

20:22.100 --> 20:27.190
<b>Indeed. You're the one
that needs to grow up.</b>

20:27.190 --> 20:29.610
<b>F-Father...</b>

20:32.740 --> 20:36.490
<b>Oh, you're finally smiling.</b>

20:36.490 --> 20:42.250
<b>Oh, you're right. Good job, my dear.
Was this your plan all along?</b>

20:42.250 --> 20:45.710
<b>Um, yes, actually.</b>

20:45.710 --> 20:48.090
<b>Really?</b>

20:49.510 --> 20:53.630
<b>Have a safe trip, Elia.
Enjoy your life at school.</b>

20:53.630 --> 20:57.810
<b>Yes. This is a good opportunity
for you to try many things.</b>

20:57.810 --> 21:03.770
<b>Yes. I'm sure being the daughter of the duke
would attract some unwanted attention,</b>

21:03.770 --> 21:05.770
<b>but you should be able to handle it.</b>

21:05.770 --> 21:10.070
<b>Yes. My lady, your judgment
of character is impeccable.</b>

21:10.070 --> 21:15.570
<b>There is nothing for us
to worry about, is there?</b>

21:22.000 --> 21:23.750
<b>You should get going.</b>

21:23.750 --> 21:27.840
<b>Yes! I'll really be taking off now!</b>

21:33.380 --> 21:36.220
<b>Hughes, Camil, we're counting on you!</b>

22:00.950 --> 22:05.040
<b>Mr. Ryoma, I'll do my best!</b>
